sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Agent Pay failure: the keyid is not in the key directory
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: Agent Pay failure: the keyid is not in the key directory. 4 participants: Agent platform, CDN or edge (Cloudflare), Mastercard key directory, and Merchant. 4 steps, 3 crossing a trust boundary, 1 failure branch. Based on mastercard-agent-pay Agent Pay developer guides (unversioned, read 2026-10-11) (2026-10-11). Step 1: Agent platform to CDN or edge (Cloudflare): Signed request, unknown keyid. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: CDN or edge (Cloudflare) to Mastercard key directory: Look up keyid. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 3: CDN or edge (Cloudflare) to Agent platform: Block. This step crosses a trust boundary. If Key not found: Request blocked. Step 4: CDN or edge (Cloudflare) to Merchant: Log the attempt.
  autonumber
  participant p_agent as Agent platform
  participant p_cdn as CDN or edge (Cloudflare)
  participant p_directory as Mastercard key directory
  participant p_merchant as Merchant
  p_agent->>p_cdn: Signed request, unknown keyid
  Note over p_agent,p_cdn: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_cdn->>p_directory: Look up keyid
  Note over p_cdn,p_directory: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_cdn->>p_agent: Block
    Note over p_cdn,p_agent: Crosses a trust boundary
  else Key not found
    Note over p_cdn,p_agent: Request blocked
  end
  p_cdn->>p_merchant: Log the attempt
